<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Data Privacy Classroom</title>
    <style>
        body {
            font-family: Arial, sans-serif;
            background: #fff0f4;
            padding: 25px;
        }
        .container {
            max-width: 850px;
            margin: auto;
            background: white;
            padding: 25px;
            border-radius: 16px;
        }
        h1 { text-align: center; color: #b73561; }
        .tip {
            background: #ffe8ef;
            padding: 18px;
            margin: 15px 0;
            border-radius: 12px;
        }
        h2 { color: #b73561; }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
<div class="container">
    <h1>🔐 Data Privacy Classroom</h1>

    <div class="tip">
        <h2>Personal Information</h2>
        <p>Be careful when sharing your address, phone number or other private information online.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="tip">
        <h2>Strong Passwords</h2>
        <p>Use long, unique passwords for different accounts.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="tip">
        <h2>App Permissions</h2>
        <p>Review which permissions an app requests and allow only what it needs.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="tip">
        <h2>Secure Connections</h2>
        <p>Be cautious when using public Wi-Fi, especially when accessing sensitive accounts.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="tip">
        <h2>Think Before Sharing</h2>
        <p>Check who can see your posts, photos and shared files before publishing them.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="tip">
        <h2>Remember</h2>
        <p>Protecting privacy is an important part of being a responsible digital citizen.</p>
    </div>
</div>
</body>
</html>
